abstract: >-
  An independent reference guide preserving original editorial accounts of
  iPhone OS 1.1.4 research, with environment-specific evidence summaries,
  limitations, public architectural references and a connected concept map.
  Private experimental artifacts are not distributed and independent public
  reproduction is not claimed.
